# Pinned commit of github.com/mstan/psxrecomp (the shared framework) used to
# build this repo. Bumping this is a deliberate, reviewable change — psxrecomp
# is a separate repo evolving on its own cadence. Update via:
#   git -C ../psxrecomp rev-parse master > /tmp/sha && \
#     sed -i "s|^sha=.*|sha=$(cat /tmp/sha)|" psxrecomp-v4.pin
branch=master
sha=f046d52
# Bumped 2026-06-16 (GL draw batching — 16:9 lag fix): psxrecomp master f046d52
# merges perf/gl-frame-timing. The OpenGL renderer was immediate-mode (~1000
# prims/frame, each its own glDrawArrays at ~14us GPU time — pipeline-flush
# overhead; native-wide doubled it). Fixed by batching consecutive textured
# prims sharing blend/mask/texwindow/filter into one draw (per-prim texture
# state moved to flat vertex attributes). Measured (frame_perf, the new GPU/CPU
# phase-timing tooling also in this bump): Tomba village 16:9 scene_gpu
# 28.3->16.0ms (~34->~60fps), 4:3 16.5->5.5ms (3x headroom). Runtime-only
# (GL renderer + debug_server), no emitter/regen/overlay-ABI impact. Does NOT
# include the parked [widescreen.cull] auto_backdrop (feat/ws-backdrop-coverage).
# ---- prior pin (OpenGL 16:9 native-wide) ----
# Bumped 2026-06-15 (OpenGL 16:9 native-wide): psxrecomp master fff384d adds the
# GL wide compositor — native-wide widescreen now works on the OpenGL backend
# (per-base wide FBOs + double-draw with x-shifted projection; GPU-direct present
# via glBlitFramebuffer, no per-frame readback so it's as fast as 4:3). Launcher
# Widescreen toggle is un-gated on GL (shown on both renderers; window size
# follows aspect). Bug fixes folded in: correct readback orientation, real
# internal-scale reporting (glb_scale), present buffer sized for the true scale.
# USER-VALIDATED: GL 16:9 renders full-frame, right-side-up, smooth. Solid /
# ready to ship (no release cut yet). 21:9 still stubbed-hidden; sljit on-disk
# persistence still deferred (feat/sljit-persist-cache).
# ---- prior pin (sljit Tier-2 + cache versioning + shared ws cull) ----
# Bumped 2026-06-15 (sljit Tier-2 + cache versioning + shared ws cull): psxrecomp
# master 0c1f005 merges feat/sljit-backend (sljit in-process JIT, Tier-2 between
# gcc cache and interp) and adds: (1) one shared psx_ws_cull_sltiu helper that
# gcc/sljit/interp all route the auto_screen_x render-funnel widen through, so
# overlay 3D widens in 16:9 on every execution path; (2) versioned overlay cache
# path gcc/<arch-abi>/cg<N> so a new emitter build never reuses a stale DLL;
# (3) sljit DEFAULT-ON (validated) — gcc>sljit>interp, sljit fills gcc-absent
# regions, shards diff-gated (device/diverging -> interp), declined -> interp, no
# crash. Verified: live=1, 62 shards, native:interp ~31%->~87%. REMAINING (next
# session): OpenGL 16:9 compositor port (widescreen still SW-only); sljit on-disk
# persistence (greenfield — re-JITs in-session today).
# ---- prior pin (21:9 docs) ----
