# as stubbed-but-hidden (engine handles it; backdrop generation only covers ~16:9,
# so it stays out of the launcher until widened -> future 3-way Off/16:9/21:9).
# ---- prior pin (native-wide 16:9 landed) ----
# Bumped 2026-06-15 (native-wide 16:9 LANDED ON MASTER): feat/native-wide merged
# to psxrecomp master (fast-forward) = native-wide compositor + auto-cull screen-X
# widening + full-screen-overlay fix + the experimental Widescreen launcher toggle
# (software-renderer gated, hidden on OpenGL). One exe serves 4:3 (default,
# byte-identical) and 16:9 (opt-in). USER-VALIDATED at 16:9. feat/native-wide also
# merged to TombaRecomp master. 21:9 is numerically free (all aspect-derived) but
